# Maximize, restore, snap halves, fullscreen.
key super+shift+Return
wait-toplevel foot 4000
key super+Up
shot 01-maximized
key super+Down
shot 02-restored
key super+Left
shot 03-snap-left
key super+Right
shot 04-snap-left-restored
key super+Right
shot 05-snap-right
key super+Return
shot 06-fullscreen
key super+Return
shot 07-unfullscreen
